# NixPresso home-config manifest.
#
# Format : <glob-relative-to-$HOME>  <class>
# Match  : first match wins; a path not listed here defaults to `track-conservative`.
# Globs  : `*` matches within one path segment, `**` matches across segments,
#          `?` matches a single non-slash char. Everything else is literal.
#
# Classes
#   track               Full 3-way sync. On conflict: take repo, back up the user's
#                       file, journal it, offer the post-run resolver. Eligible to be
#                       deleted when upstream drops the file. DESTRUCTIVE actions
#                       (take-repo-overwrite, upstream-delete) apply ONLY to `track`.
#   track-conservative  (default for any unlisted managed path) 3-way merge allowed,
#                       but on conflict KEEP THE USER's file. Never a delete candidate.
#   seed-once           Copied only if absent. Never merged, overwritten, deleted, or
#                       baselined.
#   generated           Owned by its generator (e.g. init-monitors.sh). Exempt from
#                       baseline, merge, take-repo and delete. Any stale baseline for
#                       the path is purged.
#   ignore              Not managed at all.

.config/hypr/monitors.lua            generated
.config/hypr/.monitors.hash          generated
.config/hypr/*.lua                    track
.config/hypr/*.conf                   track
.config/hypr/scripts/*                track
.config/qs-dock/settings.json        seed-once
.config/qs-dock/**                    track
.config/quickshell/**                 track
.config/kitty/**                      track
.config/mako/**                       track
.config/rofi/**                       track
.local/share/rofi/**                  track
.local/bin/*                          track
